{"chapter":{"sura":75,"name_arabic":"القيامة","name_english":"The Resurrection","transliteration":"Al-Qiyamah","juz":29,"origin":"Meccan","revelation_order":31,"verse_count":40,"display_basmalah":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ"},"verses":[{"sura":75,"aya":1,"key":"75:1","arabic":"لَآ أُقْسِمُ بِيَوْمِ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","english":"I swear by the Day of Resurrection!","transliteration_html":"L<u>a</u> oqsimu biyawmi alqiy<u>a</u>mat<b>i</b>","transliteration_text":"La oqsimu biyawmi alqiyamati"},{"sura":75,"aya":2,"key":"75:2","arabic":"وَلَآ أُقْسِمُ بِٱلنَّفْسِ ٱللَّوَّامَةِ","english":"And I swear by the self-critical soul!","transliteration_html":"Wal<u>a</u> oqsimu bi<b>al</b>nnafsi allaww<u>a</u>mat<b>i</b>","transliteration_text":"Wala oqsimu bialnnafsi allawwamati"},{"sura":75,"aya":3,"key":"75:3","arabic":"أَيَحْسَبُ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ أَلَّن نَّجْمَعَ عِظَامَهُۥ","english":"Does man suppose that We will not put together his bones [at resurrection]?","transliteration_html":"Aya<u>h</u>sabu alins<u>a</u>nu allan najmaAAa AAi<i><u>th</u></i><u>a</u>mah<b>u</b>","transliteration_text":"Ayahsabu alinsanu allan najmaAAa AAithamahu"},{"sura":75,"aya":4,"key":"75:4","arabic":"بَلَىٰ قَـٰدِرِينَ عَلَىٰٓ أَن نُّسَوِّىَ بَنَانَهُۥ","english":"Yes indeed, We are able to [re]shape [even] his fingertips!","transliteration_html":"Bal<u>a</u> q<u>a</u>direena AAal<u>a</u> an nusawwiya ban<u>a</u>nah<b>u</b>","transliteration_text":"Bala qadireena AAala an nusawwiya bananahu"},{"sura":75,"aya":5,"key":"75:5","arabic":"بَلْ يُرِيدُ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ لِيَفْجُرَ أَمَامَهُۥ","english":"Indeed, man desires to go on living viciously.","transliteration_html":"Bal yureedu alins<u>a</u>nu liyafjura am<u>a</u>mah<b>u</b>","transliteration_text":"Bal yureedu alinsanu liyafjura amamahu"},{"sura":75,"aya":6,"key":"75:6","arabic":"يَسْـَٔلُ أَيَّانَ يَوْمُ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","english":"He asks, ‘When will be this “day of resurrection”?!’","transliteration_html":"Yasalu ayy<u>a</u>na yawmu alqiy<u>a</u>ma<b>ti</b>","transliteration_text":"Yasalu ayyana yawmu alqiyamati"},{"sura":75,"aya":7,"key":"75:7","arabic":"فَإِذَا بَرِقَ ٱلْبَصَرُ","english":"But when the eyes are dazzled,","transliteration_html":"Fai<u>tha</u> bariqa alba<u>s</u>ar<b>u</b>","transliteration_text":"Faitha bariqa albasaru"},{"sura":75,"aya":8,"key":"75:8","arabic":"وَخَسَفَ ٱلْقَمَرُ","english":"the moon is eclipsed,","transliteration_html":"Wakhasafa alqamar<b>u</b>","transliteration_text":"Wakhasafa alqamaru"},{"sura":75,"aya":9,"key":"75:9","arabic":"وَجُمِعَ ٱلشَّمْسُ وَٱلْقَمَرُ","english":"and the sun and the moon are brought together,","transliteration_html":"WajumiAAa a<b>l</b>shshamsu wa<b>a</b>lqamar<b>u</b>","transliteration_text":"WajumiAAa alshshamsu waalqamaru"},{"sura":75,"aya":10,"key":"75:10","arabic":"يَقُولُ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ يَوْمَئِذٍ أَيْنَ ٱلْمَفَرُّ","english":"that day man will say, ‘Where is the escape [from this day]?’","transliteration_html":"Yaqoolu alins<u>a</u>nu yawmai<u>th</u>in ayna almafar<b>ru</b>","transliteration_text":"Yaqoolu alinsanu yawmaithin ayna almafarru"},{"sura":75,"aya":11,"key":"75:11","arabic":"كَلَّا لَا وَزَرَ","english":"No indeed! There will be no refuge!","transliteration_html":"Kall<u>a</u> l<u>a</u> wazar<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Kalla la wazara"},{"sura":75,"aya":12,"key":"75:12","arabic":"إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ يَوْمَئِذٍ ٱلْمُسْتَقَرُّ","english":"That day the [final] goal will be toward your Lord.","transliteration_html":"Il<u>a</u> rabbika yawmai<u>th</u>in almustaqar<b>ru</b>","transliteration_text":"Ila rabbika yawmaithin almustaqarru"},{"sura":75,"aya":13,"key":"75:13","arabic":"يُنَبَّؤُا۟ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ يَوْمَئِذٍۭ بِمَا قَدَّمَ وَأَخَّرَ","english":"That day man will be informed about what [works] he had sent ahead [to the scene of judgement] and [the legacy that he had] left behind.","transliteration_html":"Yunabbao alins<u>a</u>nu yawmai<u>th</u>in bim<u>a</u> qaddama waakhkhar<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Yunabbao alinsanu yawmaithin bima qaddama waakhkhara"},{"sura":75,"aya":14,"key":"75:14","arabic":"بَلِ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ عَلَىٰ نَفْسِهِۦ بَصِيرَةٌۭ","english":"Indeed, man is a witness to himself,","transliteration_html":"Bali alins<u>a</u>nu AAal<u>a</u> nafsihi ba<u>s</u>eera<b>tun</b>","transliteration_text":"Bali alinsanu AAala nafsihi baseeratun"},{"sura":75,"aya":15,"key":"75:15","arabic":"وَلَوْ أَلْقَىٰ مَعَاذِيرَهُۥ","english":"though he should offer excuses [to justify his failings].","transliteration_html":"Walaw alq<u>a</u> maAA<u>ath</u>eerah<b>u</b>","transliteration_text":"Walaw alqa maAAatheerahu"},{"sura":75,"aya":16,"key":"75:16","arabic":"لَا تُحَرِّكْ بِهِۦ لِسَانَكَ لِتَعْجَلَ بِهِۦٓ","english":"Do not move your tongue with it to hasten it.","transliteration_html":"L<u>a</u> tu<u>h</u>arrik bihi lis<u>a</u>naka litaAAjala bih<b>i</b>","transliteration_text":"La tuharrik bihi lisanaka litaAAjala bihi"},{"sura":75,"aya":17,"key":"75:17","arabic":"إِنَّ عَلَيْنَا جَمْعَهُۥ وَقُرْءَانَهُۥ","english":"Indeed it is up to Us to put it together and to recite it.","transliteration_html":"Inna AAalayn<u>a</u> jamAAahu waqur<u>a</u>nah<b>u</b>","transliteration_text":"Inna AAalayna jamAAahu waquranahu"},{"sura":75,"aya":18,"key":"75:18","arabic":"فَإِذَا قَرَأْنَـٰهُ فَٱتَّبِعْ قُرْءَانَهُۥ","english":"And when We have recited it, follow its recitation.","transliteration_html":"Fai<u>tha</u> qaran<u>a</u>hu fa<b>i</b>ttabiAA qur<u>a</u>nah<b>u</b>","transliteration_text":"Faitha qaranahu faittabiAA quranahu"},{"sura":75,"aya":19,"key":"75:19","arabic":"ثُمَّ إِنَّ عَلَيْنَا بَيَانَهُۥ","english":"Then, its exposition [also] lies with Us.","transliteration_html":"Thumma inna AAalayn<u>a</u> bay<u>a</u>nah<b>u</b>","transliteration_text":"Thumma inna AAalayna bayanahu"},{"sura":75,"aya":20,"key":"75:20","arabic":"كَلَّا بَلْ تُحِبُّونَ ٱلْعَاجِلَةَ","english":"No! Indeed, you love this transitory life","transliteration_html":"Kall<u>a</u> bal tu<u>h</u>ibboona alAA<u>a</u>jila<b>ta</b>","transliteration_text":"Kalla bal tuhibboona alAAajilata"},{"sura":75,"aya":21,"key":"75:21","arabic":"وَتَذَرُونَ ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةَ","english":"and forsake the Hereafter.","transliteration_html":"Wata<u>th</u>aroona al<u>a</u>khira<b>ta</b>","transliteration_text":"Watatharoona alakhirata"},{"sura":75,"aya":22,"key":"75:22","arabic":"وُجُوهٌۭ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ نَّاضِرَةٌ","english":"Some faces will be fresh on that day,","transliteration_html":"Wujoohun yawmai<u>th</u>in n<u>ad</u>ira<b>tun</b>","transliteration_text":"Wujoohun yawmaithin nadiratun"},{"sura":75,"aya":23,"key":"75:23","arabic":"إِلَىٰ رَبِّهَا نَاظِرَةٌۭ","english":"looking to their Lord,","transliteration_html":"Il<u>a</u> rabbih<u>a</u> n<u>a</u><i><u>th</u></i>ira<b>tun</b>","transliteration_text":"Ila rabbiha nathiratun"},{"sura":75,"aya":24,"key":"75:24","arabic":"وَوُجُوهٌۭ يَوْمَئِذٍۭ بَاسِرَةٌۭ","english":"and some faces will be scowling on that day,","transliteration_html":"Wawujoohun yawmai<u>th</u>in b<u>a</u>sira<b>tun</b>","transliteration_text":"Wawujoohun yawmaithin basiratun"},{"sura":75,"aya":25,"key":"75:25","arabic":"تَظُنُّ أَن يُفْعَلَ بِهَا فَاقِرَةٌۭ","english":"knowing that they will be dealt out a punishment breaking the spine.","transliteration_html":"Ta<i><u>th</u></i>unnu an yufAAala bih<u>a</u> f<u>a</u>qira<b>tun</b>","transliteration_text":"Tathunnu an yufAAala biha faqiratun"},{"sura":75,"aya":26,"key":"75:26","arabic":"كَلَّآ إِذَا بَلَغَتِ ٱلتَّرَاقِىَ","english":"No indeed! When it reaches up to the collar bones","transliteration_html":"Kall<u>a</u> i<u>tha</u> balaghati a<b>l</b>ttar<u>a</u>qiy<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Kalla itha balaghati alttaraqiya"},{"sura":75,"aya":27,"key":"75:27","arabic":"وَقِيلَ مَنْ ۜ رَاقٍۢ","english":"and it is said, ‘Who will take him up?’","transliteration_html":"Waqeela man r<u>a</u>q<b>in</b>","transliteration_text":"Waqeela man raqin"},{"sura":75,"aya":28,"key":"75:28","arabic":"وَظَنَّ أَنَّهُ ٱلْفِرَاقُ","english":"and he knows that it is the [time of] parting,","transliteration_html":"Wa<i><u>th</u></i>anna annahu alfir<u>a</u>q<b>u</b>","transliteration_text":"Wathanna annahu alfiraqu"},{"sura":75,"aya":29,"key":"75:29","arabic":"وَٱلْتَفَّتِ ٱلسَّاقُ بِٱلسَّاقِ","english":"and each shank clasps the other shank,","transliteration_html":"Wa<b>i</b>ltaffati a<b>l</b>ss<u>a</u>qu bi<b>a</b>lss<u>a</u>q<b>i</b>","transliteration_text":"Wailtaffati alssaqu bialssaqi"},{"sura":75,"aya":30,"key":"75:30","arabic":"إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ يَوْمَئِذٍ ٱلْمَسَاقُ","english":"that day he shall be driven toward your Lord.","transliteration_html":"Il<u>a</u> rabbika yawmai<u>th</u>in almas<u>a</u>q<b>u</b>","transliteration_text":"Ila rabbika yawmaithin almasaqu"},{"sura":75,"aya":31,"key":"75:31","arabic":"فَلَا صَدَّقَ وَلَا صَلَّىٰ","english":"He neither confirmed [the messages of Allah], nor did he pray,","transliteration_html":"Fal<u>a</u> <u>s</u>addaqa wal<u>a</u> <u>s</u>all<u>a</u>","transliteration_text":"Fala saddaqa wala salla"},{"sura":75,"aya":32,"key":"75:32","arabic":"وَلَـٰكِن كَذَّبَ وَتَوَلَّىٰ","english":"but denied [them] and turned away,","transliteration_html":"Wal<u>a</u>kin ka<u>thth</u>aba watawall<u>a</u>","transliteration_text":"Walakin kaththaba watawalla"},{"sura":75,"aya":33,"key":"75:33","arabic":"ثُمَّ ذَهَبَ إِلَىٰٓ أَهْلِهِۦ يَتَمَطَّىٰٓ","english":"and went back swaggering to his family.","transliteration_html":"Thumma <u>th</u>ahaba il<u>a</u> ahlihi yatama<u>tta</u>","transliteration_text":"Thumma thahaba ila ahlihi yatamatta"},{"sura":75,"aya":34,"key":"75:34","arabic":"أَوْلَىٰ لَكَ فَأَوْلَىٰ","english":"So, woe to you! Woe to you!","transliteration_html":"Awl<u>a</u> laka faawl<u>a</u>","transliteration_text":"Awla laka faawla"},{"sura":75,"aya":35,"key":"75:35","arabic":"ثُمَّ أَوْلَىٰ لَكَ فَأَوْلَىٰٓ","english":"Again, woe to you! Woe to you!","transliteration_html":"Thumma awl<u>a</u> laka faawl<u>a</u>","transliteration_text":"Thumma awla laka faawla"},{"sura":75,"aya":36,"key":"75:36","arabic":"أَيَحْسَبُ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ أَن يُتْرَكَ سُدًى","english":"Does man suppose that he has been abandoned to futility?","transliteration_html":"Aya<u>h</u>sabu alins<u>a</u>nu an yutraka sud<u>a</u><b>n</b>","transliteration_text":"Ayahsabu alinsanu an yutraka sudan"},{"sura":75,"aya":37,"key":"75:37","arabic":"أَلَمْ يَكُ نُطْفَةًۭ مِّن مَّنِىٍّۢ يُمْنَىٰ","english":"Was he not a drop of emitted semen,","transliteration_html":"Alam yaku nu<u>t</u>fatan min manayyin yumn<u>a</u>","transliteration_text":"Alam yaku nutfatan min manayyin yumna"},{"sura":75,"aya":38,"key":"75:38","arabic":"ثُمَّ كَانَ عَلَقَةًۭ فَخَلَقَ فَسَوَّىٰ","english":"and then a clinging mass? Whereat He created and proportioned [him],","transliteration_html":"Thumma k<u>a</u>na AAalaqatan fakhalaqa fasaww<u>a</u>","transliteration_text":"Thumma kana AAalaqatan fakhalaqa fasawwa"},{"sura":75,"aya":39,"key":"75:39","arabic":"فَجَعَلَ مِنْهُ ٱلزَّوْجَيْنِ ٱلذَّكَرَ وَٱلْأُنثَىٰٓ","english":"and made of him the two sexes, male and female.","transliteration_html":"FajaAAala minhu a<b>l</b>zzawjayni a<b>l</b><u>thth</u>akara wa<b>a</b>lonth<u>a</u>","transliteration_text":"FajaAAala minhu alzzawjayni alththakara waalontha"},{"sura":75,"aya":40,"key":"75:40","arabic":"أَلَيْسَ ذَٰلِكَ بِقَـٰدِرٍ عَلَىٰٓ أَن يُحْـِۧىَ ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ","english":"Is not [someone like] that able to revive the dead?","transliteration_html":"Alaysa <u>tha</u>lika biq<u>a</u>dirin AAal<u>a</u> an yu<u>h</u>yiya almawt<u>a</u>","transliteration_text":"Alaysa thalika biqadirin AAala an yuhyiya almawta"}]}